12. Validation Engine Design
The system validates the following.

Validation 1. Dashboard validity. Every dashboard is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Provenance completeness.

Validation 5. Audit completeness.

Validation 6. Moderation completeness.

Validation 7. Source consistency. The source data must be consistent with the source apps.

Validation 8. Metric consistency. The metrics must be consistent with each other and with the source data.

Validation 9. Trend consistency. The trends must be consistent with the metrics over time.

Validation 10. Comparison consistency. The comparisons must be consistent with the compared fields.

Validation 11. Rate consistency. The replication rate and the retraction rate must be consistent with the metrics.

Validation 12. Distribution consistency. The evidence strength distribution must sum to the total.

